# A guard comparing the thread index with a CTA index, read under the
# record's grid. In set_mla_kv_buffer_kernel_norope
# `8·(%tid.x mod 128) + 1024·%ctaid.y < 576` guards a 16 B load and
# store. The grid is 8192x1x1, so %ctaid.y is 0: the store runs on 72
# threads of each CTA, 589824 times over the launch, and each of the
# 8192 CTAs loads 2176 B and stores 1152 B.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/b200/rope_kv__deepseek-v3__prefill__sgl_mla_set_norope.set_mla_kv_buffer_kernel_norope.sm_100a.ptx --ncu %fixtures/b200/rope_kv__deepseek-v3__prefill__sgl_mla_set_norope.set_mla_kv_buffer_kernel_norope.sm_100a.ncu.json | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry set_mla_kv_buffer_kernel_norope( // grid 8192×1×1 | block 128×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | per launch: global load 17,825,792 B, store 9,437,184 B; param load 25,165,824 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.v4.b32 [ %rd4 + 0 ], { %r1, %r2, %r3, %r4 }; // warp 0-1 × lane * ∪ warp 2 × lane 0-7 | exec 589,824/launch | global store [2048·%ctaid.y + 16·(%tid.x mod 128) + 1152·uniform(%rd1@66) + param_0] sectors/req 4–17 (ideal 4–16){{$}}
